  <Properties>
    <Name>Dolen2's Ethnic Diversity for VP (vanilla scale)</Name>
    <Stability>Beta</Stability>
    <Teaser>BETA5 - E.D. UNIT PACK v.1 REQUIRED!</Teaser>
    <Description>Ethnic Diversity for Civilization V: Brave New World[NEWLINE]ETHNIC DIVERSITY UNIT PACK v.1 REQUIRED![NEWLINE]Over 1000  new unit models for diversity, with no change to gameplay.  See newunits.xlsm or forum thread on CivFanatics website for details.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Cannot be activated at the same time as Ethnic Diversity (RED Scale), Ethnic Diversity (Xtreme Scale), Hulfgar's Modpack, Ethnic Units, R.E.D. Modpack, R.E.D. Xtreme, R.E.D. - Just Ethnic Diversity, Single Unit Graphics, Reduced Unit Graphics, or Fewer Unit Graphics.</Description>
    <Authors>Nutty, Dolen2</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>All unit makers, CivFanatics</SpecialThanks>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <Homepage>http://forums.civfanatics.com/showthread.php?t=383375</Homepage>
    <AffectsSavedGames>0</AffectsSavedGames>
